WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
This army under Zhao Jueming's city

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,360
They are the knight heroes of my big fish, they have traveled thousands of miles to attack

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,320
Approaching the capital of King Qi

4
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:07,040
After forcing Zhang Yuanshan's army back, the danger of Dingyuan was relieved and the city gates were immediately opened.

5
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,240
Welcome the heroes into the city, Your Highness

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,080
They went into Wonderland alone for months

7
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,120
Who can guarantee that there are no spies from the Qi Army?

8
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,200
The sword of this general

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,720
Let them station themselves in the wasteland outside the city first

10
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,880
Wait until it is fully verified

11
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:19,040
It’s not too late to enter the city again, Zhao Jueming

12
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,680
They are sending out orders on the periphery where big fish are bleeding

13
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:32,220
But you let them starve in the wilderness, are they still human? Your Highness, you shamelessly issued orders without a general to guard them.

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,100
The warehouse is not allowed to let you in. I'll kill you, Brother Li. It's getting late.

15
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,220
A hard bed will only do things. If you are accused of treason, retreat first and set up camp.

16
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,140
Discuss tomorrow

17
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:41,420
The entire army retreated three miles and set up camp.

18
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,820
We'll die outside for a long time

19
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,420
Put your head on your waist and try your best

20
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,540
Now Mr. Li is not even allowed to enter

21
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,620
Damn it, right?

22
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,620
Let's capture the capital of King Qi

23
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,540
It's like exploring the fog of wolves

24
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,700
I'm still afraid of this little Dingyuan County

25
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:58,860
Just go straight in. If you are rebelling, shut the hell up. We have no food and grass reserves. This has no basis. What can we do to protest? What's more, the eldest princess takes me and I can't wait for you. If you rebel, are you going to take the eldest princess?

26
00:00:58,860 --> 00:00:59,940
Put to death?

27
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:05,770
What's going on?
